MtChimney_Mountain_TextMaxieIntro::
	.string "MAXIE: These data are remarkable.\nThe METEORITE amplifies the heat.\p"
	.string "A researcher should understand.\nA controlled eruption makes land!$"

MtChimney_Mountain_TextMaxieDefeat::
	.string "You measured our strength well...$"

MtChimney_Mountain_TextMaxieAfter::
	.string "MAXIE: I will halt this test.\nOur research is far from over.$"

MtChimney_Mountain_TextNeedTabitha::
	.string "MAXIE: My field officer is below.\nDeal with him before interrupting.$"

MtChimney_Mountain_TextArchieAfter::
	.string "ARCHIE: The readings are settling.\nYou stopped it just in time.\p"
	.string "Take the METEORITE from the device.\nCOZMO should study it safely.$"

MtChimney_Mountain_TextArchieBusy::
	.string "ARCHIE: I will hold this lot here.\nTheir leader is at the machine!$"

MtChimney_Mountain_TextBusy::
