MtChimney_Mountain_TextFull::
	.string "There is no room in your BAG.\nThe sample will stay safe here.$"

MtChimney_Mountain_TextRecovered::
	.string "The METEORITE is secure.\nCOZMO lives in FALLARBOR TOWN.$"

MtChimney_Mountain_TextStored::
	.string "Your METEORITE is in the PC.\nWithdraw it before seeing COZMO.$"

MtChimney_Mountain_TextTabithaIntro::
	.string "TABITHA: Leave the summit to us!$"

MtChimney_Mountain_TextTabithaDefeat::
